    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tap your way through never-ending staircases, racing to the top before your time runs out!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stair Tap is a game of fast reflexes and fast fingers. Your objective is to speed your way to the top with various challenges such as lava, time limits, and crashing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stair Tap offers a variety of game modes, including:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic - The classic gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race - Race to the 200th stair before your time runs out</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rising Lava - Escape the lava in a never-ending loop</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lights Out - Scale your way through the darkness</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flipped - Classic.. But sideways!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freebie - Enjoy some free money</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless - Do whatever!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can <strong>you </strong>get the fastest time?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is heavily inspired by the game &quot;Stair Tappers&quot;.</p>",
